## Town rate
The town pays your wage out of the estate rate. When you call at a shop on your rounds and the keeper is there, the rate on their estate is taken into the town chest as you arrive — none of it passes through your purse. What is taken is the town's, not yours to hand back.
Weigh what's in front of you — obligations and pressing needs come before idle matters. Choose one action, then call done() when nothing pressing remains.
